WEBVTT

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:30.679
In the tempest,

00:02:30.679 --> 00:02:34.429
the Doliones 
thought these new arrivals invaders.

00:02:34.429 --> 00:02:37.896
The Argonauts were similarly unaware 
of their surroundings,

00:02:37.896 --> 00:02:42.476
and fought blunderingly in the dark, 
slaying wave after wave of foe.

00:02:42.476 --> 00:02:45.927
But the morning light 
revealed a horrible truth:

00:02:45.927 --> 00:02:50.587
their victims 
were none other than their previous hosts.

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:51.344
Yet again,

00:02:51.344 --> 00:02:54.334
Jason had allowed the crew 
to be distracted,

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:56.734
this time at a terrible cost.

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.115
Ashamed at his conduct,

00:02:58.115 --> 00:03:01.145
he resolved 
to focus only on the Fleece,